{"id":"a1bf25d5239f3f6e","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-net.md","title":"Proof Net","display":"df-proof-net — Proof Net","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-net","aliases":["72-df-proof-net"],"display":"df-proof-net — Proof Net","depends_on":["[[72-df-linear-logic]]","[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, Appendix B §B.3 print154–157; Supplement Danos–Regnier, The structure of multiplicatives, Archive for Mathematical Logic 28 (1989) 181–203, https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01622878; unit-free, cut-free MLL switching instance","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-net"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-net</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-net — Proof Net"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, Appendix B §B.3 print154–157; Supplement Danos–Regnier, The structure of multiplicatives, Archive for Mathematical Logic 28 (1989) 181–203, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01622878\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01622878</a>; unit-free, cut-free MLL switching instance"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-proof-net-—-Unit-free-MLL-Proof-Net\">df-proof-net — Unit-free MLL Proof Net</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a> 的字面量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\otimes,\\mathbin{⅋}\">\\(\\otimes,\\mathbin{⅋}\\)</span> 与否定，限定无单位、无cut的乘法片段。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\langle V,B,\\ell,C,a\\rangle\">\\(N=\\langle V,B,\\ell,C,a\\rangle\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(V\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 非空有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:V\\rightharpoonup V\\times V\">\\(B:V\\rightharpoonup V\\times V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:V\\to\\mathcal F_{LL}\">\\(\\ell:V\\to\\mathcal F_{LL}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq V\">\\(C\\subseteq V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 为偏函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(v)=\\langle u,w\\rangle\">\\(B(v)=\\langle u,w\\rangle\\)</span> 指公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的两个有序子公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_N=V\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}B\">\\(L_N=V\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_N\">\\(\\mathcal U_N\\)</span> 是满足下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Struct}\">\\(\\operatorname{Struct}\\)</span> 条件的五元组集合。所有并合操作只对不相交顶点集、合法根及新鲜顶点调用；函数并取图的并。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a>。下面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\ne v\">\\(u\\ne v\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\notin V\">\\(r\\notin V\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\notin V_1\\cup V_2\">\\(r\\notin V_1\\cup V_2\\)</span>；tensor时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_1\\cap V_2=\\varnothing\">\\(V_1\\cap V_2=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_N\">\\(\\mathcal U_N\\)</span> 的集合构造只遍历满足首条所列全部分量类型条件的五元组：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(V\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:V\\rightharpoonup V\\times V\">\\(B:V\\rightharpoonup V\\times V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:V\\to\\mathcal F_{LL}\">\\(\\ell:V\\to\\mathcal F_{LL}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq V\">\\(C\\subseteq V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\subseteq V\\times V\">\\(a\\subseteq V\\times V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^1:=E\">\\(E^1:=E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^{j+1}:=E^j\\circ E\">\\(E^{j+1}:=E^j\\circ E\\)</span> 是关系复合；有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(v)\">\\(B(v)\\)</span> 的两个子节点也记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(v)_0,B(v)_1\">\\(B(v)_0,B(v)_1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Concl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Concl}\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_N\">\\(\\mathcal U_N\\)</span> 上定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE_B&amp;:=\\{\\langle v,u\\rangle,\\langle v,w\\rangle:B(v)=\\langle u,w\\rangle\\},\\quad E_B^+:=\\bigcup_{n&gt;0}E_B^n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Struct}(N)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{dom}B\\ \\exists u\\ne w\\ (B(v)=\\langle u,w\\rangle\\land(\\ell(v)=\\ell(u)\\otimes\\ell(w)\\lor\\ell(v)=\\ell(u)\\mathbin{⅋}\\ell(w)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in V\\ |\\{v:\\langle v,w\\rangle\\in E_B\\}|\\le1\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall v\\in V\\ \\langle v,v\\rangle\\notin E_B^+\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land C=V\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(E_B)\\land\\bigl(\\forall v\\in L_N\\ \\ell(v)\\in\\{p^+,p^-:p\\in P\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land a:L_N\\to L_N\\land\\bigl(\\forall v\\in L_N\\ (a(a(v))=v\\land a(v)\\ne v\\land\\ell(a(v))=\\ell(v)^\\perp)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_N&amp;:=\\{N:\\operatorname{Struct}(N)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax}(p,u,v)&amp;:=\\langle\\{u,v\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\langle u,p^+\\rangle,\\langle v,p^-\\rangle\\},\\{u,v\\},\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle,\\langle v,u\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nT(N_1,N_2,u,v,r)&amp;:=\\langle V_1\\cup V_2\\cup\\{r\\},B_1\\cup B_2\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\langle u,v\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\ell_1\\cup\\ell_2\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\ell_1(u)\\otimes\\ell_2(v)\\rangle\\},(C_1\\cup C_2)\\setminus\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\{r\\},a_1\\cup a_2\\rangle,\\\\\nQ(N,u,v,r)&amp;:=\\langle V\\cup\\{r\\},B\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\langle u,v\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\ell\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\ell(u)\\mathbin{⅋}\\ell(v)\\rangle\\},C\\setminus\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\{r\\},a\\rangle,\\\\\nR_N&amp;:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\operatorname{Ax}(p,u,v)}\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{N_1\\quad N_2}{T(N_1,N_2,u,v,r)}:u\\in C_1,v\\in C_2\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{N}{Q(N,u,v,r)}:u,v\\in C\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProofNet}(N)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow N\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{\\mathcal U_N}(R_N),\\qquad\\operatorname{Concl}(N):=\\sum_{v\\in C}[\\ell(v)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE_B&amp;:=\\{\\langle v,u\\rangle,\\langle v,w\\rangle:B(v)=\\langle u,w\\rangle\\},\\quad E_B^+:=\\bigcup_{n&gt;0}E_B^n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Struct}(N)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{dom}B\\ \\exists u\\ne w\\ (B(v)=\\langle u,w\\rangle\\land(\\ell(v)=\\ell(u)\\otimes\\ell(w)\\lor\\ell(v)=\\ell(u)\\mathbin{⅋}\\ell(w)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in V\\ |\\{v:\\langle v,w\\rangle\\in E_B\\}|\\le1\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall v\\in V\\ \\langle v,v\\rangle\\notin E_B^+\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land C=V\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(E_B)\\land\\bigl(\\forall v\\in L_N\\ \\ell(v)\\in\\{p^+,p^-:p\\in P\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land a:L_N\\to L_N\\land\\bigl(\\forall v\\in L_N\\ (a(a(v))=v\\land a(v)\\ne v\\land\\ell(a(v))=\\ell(v)^\\perp)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_N&amp;:=\\{N:\\operatorname{Struct}(N)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax}(p,u,v)&amp;:=\\langle\\{u,v\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\langle u,p^+\\rangle,\\langle v,p^-\\rangle\\},\\{u,v\\},\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle,\\langle v,u\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nT(N_1,N_2,u,v,r)&amp;:=\\langle V_1\\cup V_2\\cup\\{r\\},B_1\\cup B_2\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\langle u,v\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\ell_1\\cup\\ell_2\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\ell_1(u)\\otimes\\ell_2(v)\\rangle\\},(C_1\\cup C_2)\\setminus\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\{r\\},a_1\\cup a_2\\rangle,\\\\\nQ(N,u,v,r)&amp;:=\\langle V\\cup\\{r\\},B\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\langle u,v\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\ell\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\ell(u)\\mathbin{⅋}\\ell(v)\\rangle\\},C\\setminus\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\{r\\},a\\rangle,\\\\\nR_N&amp;:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\operatorname{Ax}(p,u,v)}\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{N_1\\quad N_2}{T(N_1,N_2,u,v,r)}:u\\in C_1,v\\in C_2\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{N}{Q(N,u,v,r)}:u,v\\in C\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProofNet}(N)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow N\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{\\mathcal U_N}(R_N),\\qquad\\operatorname{Concl}(N):=\\sum_{v\\in C}[\\ell(v)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是按原子identity、tensor及par三种无cut序列规则生成的单位自由MLL网。顶点名只是有限自然数标签；分支并合可先改名以保证不交。Struct的森林条件确保每个公式出现仅有一个父出现，a确保叶子完整二元配对。单位及cut需要额外数据和判据，此节点不声称覆盖它们。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-proof-net-—-Unit-free-MLL-Proof-Net","text":"df-proof-net — Unit-free MLL Proof Net","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-linear-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-linear-logic]] 的字面量、$\\otimes,\\mathbin{⅋}$ 与否定，限定无单位、无cut的乘法片段。$N=\\langle V,B,\\ell,C,a\\rangle$：$V\\subseteq\\omega$ 非空有限，$B:V\\rightharpoonup V\\times V$，$\\ell:V\\to\\mathcal F_{LL}$，$C\\subseteq V$，$a$ 为偏函数。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Cl}$ 取 [[72-df-types-inference-closure]]。下面 $u\\ne v$；$r\\notin V$ 或 $r\\notin V_1\\cup V_2$；tensor时 $V_1\\cap V_2=\\varnothing$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\otimes,\\mathbin{⅋}","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\langle V,B,\\ell,C,a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B:V\\rightharpoonup V\\times V","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell:V\\to\\mathcal F_{LL}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"B(v)=\\langle u,w\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"L_N=V\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Struct}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"u\\ne v","display":false},{"tex":"r\\notin V","display":false},{"tex":"r\\notin V_1\\cup V_2","display":false},{"tex":"V_1\\cap V_2=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U_N","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B:V\\rightharpoonup V\\times V","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell:V\\to\\mathcal F_{LL}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"a\\subseteq V\\times V","display":false},{"tex":"E^1:=E","display":false},{"tex":"E^{j+1}:=E^j\\circ E","display":false},{"tex":"B(v)","display":false},{"tex":"B(v)_0,B(v)_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Concl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nE_B&:=\\{\\langle v,u\\rangle,\\langle v,w\\rangle:B(v)=\\langle u,w\\rangle\\},\\quad E_B^+:=\\bigcup_{n>0}E_B^n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Struct}(N)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{dom}B\\ \\exists u\\ne w\\ (B(v)=\\langle u,w\\rangle\\land(\\ell(v)=\\ell(u)\\otimes\\ell(w)\\lor\\ell(v)=\\ell(u)\\mathbin{⅋}\\ell(w)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in V\\ |\\{v:\\langle v,w\\rangle\\in E_B\\}|\\le1\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall v\\in V\\ \\langle v,v\\rangle\\notin E_B^+\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land C=V\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(E_B)\\land\\bigl(\\forall v\\in L_N\\ \\ell(v)\\in\\{p^+,p^-:p\\in P\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land a:L_N\\to L_N\\land\\bigl(\\forall v\\in L_N\\ (a(a(v))=v\\land a(v)\\ne v\\land\\ell(a(v))=\\ell(v)^\\perp)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_N&:=\\{N:\\operatorname{Struct}(N)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax}(p,u,v)&:=\\langle\\{u,v\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\langle u,p^+\\rangle,\\langle v,p^-\\rangle\\},\\{u,v\\},\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle,\\langle v,u\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nT(N_1,N_2,u,v,r)&:=\\langle V_1\\cup V_2\\cup\\{r\\},B_1\\cup B_2\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\langle u,v\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\\\\n&\\qquad\\ell_1\\cup\\ell_2\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\ell_1(u)\\otimes\\ell_2(v)\\rangle\\},(C_1\\cup C_2)\\setminus\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\{r\\},a_1\\cup a_2\\rangle,\\\\\nQ(N,u,v,r)&:=\\langle V\\cup\\{r\\},B\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\langle u,v\\rangle\\rangle\\},\\ell\\cup\\{\\langle r,\\ell(u)\\mathbin{⅋}\\ell(v)\\rangle\\},C\\setminus\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\{r\\},a\\rangle,\\\\\nR_N&:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\operatorname{Ax}(p,u,v)}\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{N_1\\quad N_2}{T(N_1,N_2,u,v,r)}:u\\in C_1,v\\in C_2\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{N}{Q(N,u,v,r)}:u,v\\in C\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProofNet}(N)&:\\Longleftrightarrow N\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{\\mathcal U_N}(R_N),\\qquad\\operatorname{Concl}(N):=\\sum_{v\\in C}[\\ell(v)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4126,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-net|df-proof-net — Proof Net]]"},{"id":"5bd7282c0f1ce763","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N\\in\\mathcal U_N$；$\\operatorname{ProofNet}$、$R_N$、$\\operatorname{Concl}$ 均取 [[72-df-proof-net]] 的无单位、无cut乘法片段。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-net]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-net|df-proof-net — Proof Net]]"},{"id":"f6ef88c2a6e4a8e1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N=\\langle V,B,\\ell,C,a\\rangle\\in\\mathcal U_N$ 使用 [[72-df-proof-net]]；$E_B$ 同该节点。$[V]^2$ 是 $V$ 的二元子集集合。$\\operatorname{Par}(N)$ 为外层par的内节点集，switching是从每个par恰选一个子边的函数。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-proof-net]]"}],"outgoing":["a70f24e0154f1736","a77f51439d01d542"]}